{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","塔琳"],["/names/en","Talene"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名端庄典雅的法师，擅长消耗生命值作战，并能无限复活。"],["/description_i18n/en","An elegant Mage who specializes in converting HP into magic power and possesses the ability of self-resurrection."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","让战场晴朗一些吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's brighten up the battlefield!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","每次燃烧都让我更加耀眼。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Each blaze just adds to my radiance."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","沐浴吧，圣焰的洗礼！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","Immerse yourself in the purifying flames!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我将浴火重生。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","I emerge, a phoenix in the flames."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利如阳光般闪耀。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/en","Victory gleams like the sunlight."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","阳光是我的翅膀，烈焰是我的羽毛。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Flames weave my story, and sparks mark my presence."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","真是个好天气，要让它更好一些吗？交给我吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","What a beautiful day. Want to make it even better?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","今天天气晴朗啊。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The skies are clear today."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","心情不好，要一起晒晒太阳吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Feeling down? Let's soak up some sun together!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啊，神圣又纯净的气息！我很喜欢，谢谢你的馈赠。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","What a pure aura! I love it, thank you for the gift."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢，我会善加收藏的。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Thank you, I will treasure this."],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","……这种邪恶的东西，需要我净化它吗？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/en","... Is this something you need me to purify?"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","圣焰之翼"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Resurging Flame"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","只要阳光还在照耀，她的羽毛就永远明艳。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Her feathers blaze eternal, as long as the sun's light endures."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","焰海潮生"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Azure Flame"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","炽烈的火焰分开潮水，她于浪潮间重获新生。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","A blazing fire that cuts through the waves, rising anew with the tide."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","庆典甄礼活动获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Timeless Tribute"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","谁想晒晒太阳？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Who wants to get some sun?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","喜欢我的羽毛吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","You like my feathers?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","蜂蜜！草莓！我喜欢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Honey! Strawberries! I love them both!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","下雪了，太棒了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's snowing! How amazing."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","蜂蜜！草莓！我喜欢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Honey! Strawberries! I love them both!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我来点燃壁炉"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I will light the hearth."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","鲜艳，温暖，完美"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Blazing, glowing, utterly flawless!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","请看我的火焰吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Come, behold the dance of my flames!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","听说，塔琳如果一段时间照不到太阳，不仅人会垂头丧气的，连羽毛都会褪色。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","It's said that without sunlight, Talene becomes despondent and her feathers lose their vibrant colors."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","塔琳最喜欢的“温泉浴场”是某处活火山的火山口——那里总是翻涌着灼热的岩浆。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Talene's favorite \"hot spring\" is the crater of an active volcano, where the lava bubbles and glows."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","像是大部分羽毛美丽的鸟儿一样，闲来无事时，塔琳也会独自唱歌起舞。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Talene can control the intensity of her fiery aura, making it warm and comforting or fiercely blazing."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","塔琳喜欢鲜艳和闪亮的东西——但她往往会克制自己的偏爱，保持优雅的姿态。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Talene has a secret love for bright and shiny things, but she skillfully hides her fascination to maintain an air of elegance."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","塔琳偶尔会把自己的羽毛赠送给中意的人，在必要时，它会化为庇护的火焰。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Talene sometimes gifts her feathers to those she cares about. These feathers can transform into protective flames."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","塔琳非常，非常，非常讨厌下雨，但她深知雨水对农耕的重要性，所以每逢雨季，她都会努力忍耐。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Talene despises rain because it makes her feathers soggy, but she endures it during the rainy season for the sake of the crops."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","塔琳最喜欢的工作就是在有洪涝危机时，帮忙驱散多余的雨云。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Talene occasionally visits remote villages, leaving behind trails of golden feathers as blessings."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“我曾经听过各个种族的歌唱与乐曲，但没有什么能比得过塔琳殿下随口哼唱的小调。”——某位年过古稀的知名音乐家如此评价。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","\"I've heard songs and music composed by many talents, but nothing compares to Archon Talene's casual hums,\" praised a renowned elderly musician."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","许多年前，塔琳唱歌的时候，会从四面八方吸引来许多鸟儿盘旋起舞，为她和声，那景象曾让无数人为之驻足。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Years ago, Talene's singing attracted birds from all directions to harmonize with her, creating a mesmerizing spectacle."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","作为半神，塔琳无所畏惧——但偏好仍然存在，她喜欢干燥又高温的地方，对于海洋和冰雪则是敬谢不敏。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Talene's feathers glow faintly in the dark, a subtle reminder of her Celestial heritage."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","啊，萨基塔里斯！你又在这里偷懒！"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Dionel! You're slacking off again!"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415032.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415032.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","塔琳 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Talene & Dionel"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","谁想晒晒太阳？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Who wants to get some sun?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415146.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415146.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Talene"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","蜂蜜！草莓！我喜欢！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Honey! Strawberries! I love them both!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415147.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415147.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Talene"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","看，这里完全变了个模样！充满了隆冬节的氛围！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Look at this place! It's practically buzzing with Winter Carnival vibes! The lights, the food, the drink... it's perfect!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415346.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415346.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 塔琳"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Dionel & Talene"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","下雪了，太棒了！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","It's snowing! How amazing."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415463.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415463.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Talene"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","我来点燃壁炉"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","I will light the hearth."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415464.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415464.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Talene"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，真是糟糕的温度。"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Ugh, this wretched heat."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415484.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415484.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","蒂斯妮娅 & 塔琳"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Cryonaia & Talene"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","鲜艳，温暖，完美"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Blazing, glowing, utterly flawless!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415641.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415641.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Talene"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","请看我的火焰吧"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Come, behold the dance of my flames!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415642.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415642.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Talene"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","你、你的羽毛……"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Y-Your feathers..."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415764.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415764.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","卡兹姆 & 塔琳"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Kazim & Talene"]]}